WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:11,380
They all said that you two can just come over.

2
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,420
Whose house is broken for five yuan?

3
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,820
The whole family came over for a feast

4
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,740
I also brought a dog with me.

5
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:17,380
The two of us still have to pay five yuan.

6
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,860
Lao Li's family is not in trouble

7
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,620
I still have to give Xu Dali a separate gift.

8
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:33,500
If you have to eat, eat Xiao Ming

9
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,940
Why is your arm wrapped in a bandage?

10
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:37,890
Help my sister prepare for her wedding

11
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:39,010
Fell while riding a bicycle

12
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:41,870
It hurts a lot, then that's okay

13
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:43,190
It seems that your reflection building is quite healthy.

14
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:45,230
What kind of good person is doing justice for heaven?

15
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:46,350
But it looks like he doesn’t want to say it

16
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:48,030
I guess he asked Foreigner Li to deal with me in Meicheng.

17
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:49,630
Instead, he was slapped in the arm and tongue by those people.

18
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:56,440
Huzi gives face

19
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:57,880
When my sister gets married, can you still think of giving her a gift?

20
00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:00,720
A few days ago, I didn’t pay for the ten yuan.

21
00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:02,440
The five yuan is the gift my father owes you, so I gave it to Lisuanpai.

22
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:03,840
I gave the other five yuan to Xu Dali.

23
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:07,820
You don't have much face with me here

24
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:09,420
Dali originally wanted you to be a nobody.

25
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:15,290
But if Li Xiaoyue doesn’t agree, I’ll ask someone to give it to you later. Everyone at the table is holding a mobile phone, Brother Dashan.

26
00:01:15,290 --> 00:01:16,530
You talk more than Xiao Ming

27
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:28,620
I'll help you find a cleaner table. No, we don't know each other well.

28
00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:30,220
This is my niece Lin Xiangyang coming over to play for a few days.

29
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:40,760
Your Uncle Huzi and I are just good friends, sister-in-law.

30
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:42,440
I'm just young, it's not that I don't understand love

31
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,840
You just saw Uncle Huzi walking very fast

32
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:50,380
If you talk again, I will send you back to the county seat. Dare you call me Uncle Huzi?

33
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:51,340
Not bad, not bad

34
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:55,070
This little clay boy can talk to Xiangyang.

35
00:01:55,070 --> 00:01:57,870
Your kid can talk. Uncle will go into the mountains tomorrow to get you some game to try.
